const CXYOMI={"高麗人参":"こうらいにんじん","深層湧水":"しんそうゆうすい","雪解け":"ゆきどけ","冷泉":"れいせん","天然鉱泉":"てんねんこうせん","鉱泉":"こうせん","流銀泉石":"りゅうぎんせんせき","水磨き石":"みずみがきいし","石英鉱石":"せきえいこうせき","銀鉱石":"ぎんこうせき","銅鉱石":"どうこうせき","結晶塵":"けっしょうじん","宝石":"ほうせき","石けん":"せっけん","精製":"せいせい","小麦粉":"こむぎこ","小麦茶":"むぎちゃ","小麦":"こむぎ","麦芽糖":"ばくがとう","上級":"じょうきゅう","乾燥":"かんそう","滋養":"じよう","白がゆ":"しろがゆ","米粉":"こめこ","米酢":"こめず","玄米茶":"げんまいちゃ","米":"こめ","桜花":"おうか","桜":"さくら","塩漬け":"しおづけ","塩焼き":"しおやき","海塩":"かいえん","塩":"しお","砂糖漬け":"さとうづけ","氷砂糖":"こおりざとう","砂糖":"さとう","シロップ漬け":"しろっぷづけ","醤油":"しょうゆ","焼き甘栗":"やきあまぐり","焼き大豆":"やきだいず","大豆":"だいず","豆腐":"とうふ","干し":"ほし","栗餡":"くりあん","綿布":"めんぷ","綿糸":"めんし","綿花":"めんか","染色された":"せんしょくされた","染料":"せんりょう","毛糸":"けいと","羊毛":"ようもう","生地":"きじ","麻":"あさ","繊維":"せんい","縄":"なわ","真珠":"しんじゅ","貝殻":"かいがら","工芸品":"こうげいひん","陶器":"とうき","磁器":"じき","粘土":"ねんど","岩石":"がんせき","竹かご":"たけかご","竹線香":"たけせんこう","竹":"たけ","木彫り":"きぼり","草編み":"くさあみ","玩具":"おもちゃ","生け花":"いけばな","花束":"はなたば","花びら":"はなびら","お花":"おはな","花":"はな","香晶":"こうしょう","香り":"かおり","調合香水":"ちょうごうこうすい","金粉":"きんぷん","銀粉":"ぎんぷん","鱗粉":"りんぷん","粉":"こ","傘":"かさ","風鈴":"ふうりん","追憶":"ついおく","提灯":"ちょうちん","実入り":"みいり","実":"み","菓子":"かし","飴":"あめ","甘酒":"あまざけ","粥":"かゆ","酢":"す","入り":"いり","葡萄":"ぶどう","香る":"かおる","大根":"だいこん","椒":"しょう","星":"ほし","天然ゴム":"てんねんごむ","井戸水":"いどみず","清水":"しみず","人参":"にんじん","高級":"こうきゅう","結晶":"けっしょう","焼き":"やき","茶":"ちゃ","生":"なま"};
const CXYK=Object.keys(CXYOMI).sort((a,b)=>b.length-a.length);
const CXSYN=[["いちご","すとろべり"],["りんご","あっぷる"],["ぶどう","ぐれぷ"],["ばら","ろず"],["こめ","らいす"],["じゃがいも","ぽてと"],["はな","ふらわ"],["くり","まろん"],["ちょこ","ここあ"],["はちみつ","はに"],["かえで","めぷる"],["くっき","びすけっと"]];
function cxAlt(w){ const r=[w]; for(const g of CXSYN) for(const x of g) if(w.includes(x)) for(const y of g) if(y!==x) r.push(w.split(x).join(y)); return r.map(cxNz); }
function cxNz(t){ return String(t||"").normalize("NFKC").toLowerCase().replace(/[ァ-ヶ]/g,ch=>String.fromCharCode(ch.charCodeAt(0)-0x60)).replace(/[\s・･·、。,.\-‐ー〜~()（）「」'’]/g,""); }
function cxYomi(t){ let r=String(t||""); for(const k of CXYK) r=r.split(k).join(CXYOMI[k]); return r; }
function cxFind(){ const inp=document.getElementById("cx-find"), box=document.getElementById("cx-hits"); if(!inp||!box) return; const ws=String(inp.value).normalize("NFKC").split(/\s+/).map(cxNz).filter(Boolean), q=ws.join(""); if(!q){box.innerHTML="";return;}
  const s0=document.querySelector('select[data-cxmust]'); if(!s0) return; const used=new Set(cxCond().must.filter(Boolean)); const hits=[];
  for(const o of s0.options){ if(!o.value||used.has(o.value)) continue; const lab=o.textContent; const keys=[cxNz(lab),cxNz(o.value),cxNz(cxYomi(o.value))]; if(ws.every(w=>cxAlt(w).some(v=>keys.some(k=>k.includes(v))))) hits.push([o.value,lab,keys.some(k=>k.startsWith(ws[0]))]); }
  hits.sort((a,b)=>(b[2]-a[2])||a[1].length-b[1].length);
  box.innerHTML=hits.length?hits.slice(0,12).map(([v,l])=>`<button type="button" class="cxhit" data-cxpick="${esc(v)}">${esc(l)}</button>`).join("")+(hits.length>12?`<span class="foot">ほか${hits.length-12}件</span>`:""):`<span class="foot">見つかりません</span>`; }
document.getElementById("view").addEventListener("input",e=>{ if(e.target.id==="cx-find") cxFind(); });
document.getElementById("view").addEventListener("click",e=>{ const x=e.target.closest("[data-cxclr]"); if(!x) return; e.preventDefault(); const c=cxCond(), q=+x.dataset.cxclr, old=c.must[q]; if(old) delete c.own[old]; c.must[q]=""; c.must=c.must.filter(Boolean).concat(Array(CXMUSTN).fill("")).slice(0,CXMUSTN); render(); });   // 11/25 ユーザー: 選んだ品物を「なし」に戻す×ボタン
document.getElementById("view").addEventListener("click",e=>{ const b=e.target.closest("[data-cxpick]"); if(!b) return; const c=cxCond(); const i=c.must.findIndex(x=>!x); if(i<0) return; c.must[i]=b.dataset.cxpick; render(); const f=document.getElementById("cx-find"); if(f) f.focus(); });
document.getElementById("view").addEventListener("change",e=>{const t=e.target, c=cxCond(); if(t.id==="cx-slots"){c.slots=+t.value;} else if(t.id==="cx-swmax"){c.swMax=+t.value;} else if(t.id==="cx-occ"){c.occ=t.value;} else if(t.id==="cx-has"){c.has=t.checked;} else if(t.id==="cx-pl"){c.pl=t.value;} else if(t.id==="cx-sw"){c.sw=t.value==="1"; c.ms=t.value==="2"||t.value==="3"; c.msOwn=t.value==="3";} else if(t.dataset.cxrb){c.rb[t.dataset.cxrb]=+t.value;} else if(t.dataset.cxsp){c.sp[t.dataset.cxsp]=t.checked;} else if(t.dataset.cxtp){c.tp=c.tp||{}; if(t.checked) delete c.tp[t.dataset.cxtp]; else c.tp[t.dataset.cxtp]=false;} else if(t.id==="cx-prb"){c.prb=+t.value;} else if(t.id==="cx-human"){if(+t.value) c.human=+t.value; else delete c.human;} else if(t.dataset.hum2!==undefined){c.hum2=(c.hum2||[]).slice(); c.hum2[+t.dataset.hum2]=+t.value;} else if(t.dataset.cxdev){c.dev=c.dev||{}; const a=CXMETA[state.lv].dev.find(x=>x[0]===t.dataset.cxdev); if(a&&+t.value===a[2]) delete c.dev[a[0]]; else c.dev[t.dataset.cxdev]=+t.value;} else if(t.dataset.cxflu!==undefined){cxFlSetU(c,t.dataset.cxflu,+t.dataset.i,+t.value);} else if(t.dataset.cxflc!==undefined){cxFlSetC(c,t.dataset.cxflc,+t.dataset.lv,t);} else if(t.dataset.cxmust!==undefined){const q=+t.dataset.cxmust, old=c.must[q]; c.must[q]=t.value; if(old) delete c.own[old]; c.must=c.must.filter(Boolean).concat(Array(CXMUSTN).fill("")).slice(0,CXMUSTN);} else if(t.dataset.cxown){const it=t.dataset.cxit; c.own[it]=c.own[it]||{}; c.own[it][t.dataset.cxown]=t.checked;} else return; CX.shareMsg=""; CX.shareUrl=""; render();});

// ⓘ の吹き出し
function IBH(html){return `<button type="button" class="ib" aria-label="説明" aria-expanded="false">i</button><span class="ibc" hidden>${html}</span>`;}
let IBO=null;
function ibClose(){const p=document.getElementById("ibpop"); if(p) p.remove(); if(IBO){IBO.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"); IBO=null;}}
function ibPos(){const p=document.getElementById("ibpop"); if(!p||!IBO) return; if(!IBO.isConnected){ibClose(); return;}
  const r=IBO.getBoundingClientRect(), vw=document.documentElement.clientWidth, w=Math.min(p.querySelector("table")?400:340,vw-32); p.style.width=w+"px";
  const x=Math.min(Math.max(16,r.left+r.width/2-w/2),vw-16-w); p.style.left=(x+scrollX)+"px";
  const h=p.offsetHeight, below=(r.bottom+10+h<=innerHeight)||(r.top<h+10);
  p.style.top=((below?r.bottom+10:r.top-10-h)+scrollY)+"px"; p.classList.toggle("up",!below);
  const a=p.querySelector(".ibarr"); if(a) a.style.left=Math.min(Math.max(10,r.left+r.width/2-x-6),w-22)+"px";}
function ibOpen(b){ibClose(); const c=b.nextElementSibling; if(!c||!c.classList.contains("ibc")) return;
  const p=document.createElement("div"); p.id="ibpop"; p.className="ibpop"; p.setAttribute("role","dialog"); p.setAttribute("aria-label","説明"); p.tabIndex=-1;
  p.innerHTML=`<div class="ibin">${c.innerHTML}</div><span class="ibarr" aria-hidden="true"></span>`; document.body.appendChild(p);
  b.setAttribute("aria-expanded","true"); IBO=b; ibPos(); setTimeout(ibPos,30); setTimeout(ibPos,200);}
document.addEventListener("click",e=>{const b=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest("button.ib"); if(b){e.preventDefault(); e.stopPropagation(); if(IBO===b) ibClose(); else ibOpen(b); return;}
  if(IBO&&!(e.target.closest&&e.target.closest("#ibpop"))) ibClose();},true);
document.addEventListener("keydown",e=>{if(e.key==="Escape"&&IBO){const b=IBO; ibClose(); b.focus();}});
addEventListener("resize",ibPos);

